// Rule: [T1547.001] Noderabbit - Microsoftedgeupdate Run Key
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1547.001
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: DeviceRegistryEvents
// Purpose: Exact registry-change hunt for the source observed MicrosoftEdgeUpdate value launching a renamed Node.js runtime and script from the first NodeRabbit variant.
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceRegistryEvents for microsoftedgeupdate run key using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in DeviceRegistryEvents; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: successful exploitation, malicious ownership, downstream impact, campaign attribution or complete compromise without corroborating evidence.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// NodeRabbit MicrosoftEdgeUpdate Run-key persistence
// Classification: Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
// Telemetry prerequisite: Microsoft Defender for Endpoint / DeviceRegistryEvents
// Scope: source-observed campaign persistence for NodeRabbit variant 1.
// A match establishes a matching registry modification, not successful execution or C2.

DeviceRegistryEvents
| where RegistryKey endswith @"\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run"
| where RegistryValueName =~ "MicrosoftEdgeUpdate"
| where RegistryValueData contains "nodew.exe"
| where RegistryValueData contains "msedge_update.js"
| project Timestamp,
          DeviceId, DeviceName, ActionType,
          RegistryKey, RegistryValueName, RegistryValueType, RegistryValueData,
          PreviousRegistryValueData,
          InitiatingProcessFileName, InitiatingProcessFolderPath,
          InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
          InitiatingProcessSHA1, InitiatingProcessMD5,
          InitiatingProcessAccountName, InitiatingProcessAccountSid,
          InitiatingProcessIntegrityLevel, InitiatingProcessTokenElevation,
          IsInitiatingProcessRemoteSession, InitiatingProcessRemoteSessionIP,
          ReportId
| order by Timestamp desc
